{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL090aGVyc19MYW5ndWFnZS9GcmVuY2gtTGFuZ3VhZ2UvSmVhbiUyMGRlJTIwRmxvcmV0dGUlMjAlMjgxOTg2JTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Jean de Florette","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/atjyDRdOnOi2S28X3mNtJ7CQmFj.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qNBxyt60hnzBRSHo1uRkRU34fYE.jpg","description":"In a rural French village, an old man and his only remaining relative cast their covetous eyes on an adjoining vacant property. They need its spring water for growing their flowers, and are dismayed to hear that the man who has inherited it is moving in. They block up the spring and watch as their new neighbour tries to keep his crops watered from wells far afield through the hot summer. Though they see his desperate efforts are breaking his health and his wife and daughter's hearts, they think only of getting the water.","releaseInfo":"1986","genres":["Drama","Others"],"imdbRating":"7.7","runtime":"122 min","cast":["Yves Montand","Gérard Depardieu","Daniel Auteuil","Elisabeth Depardieu","Margarita Lozano","Ernestine Mazurowna","Armand Meffre","André Dupon"],"director":["Claude Berri"],"released":"1986-08-27T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"For some men, land and water are more precious than flesh and blood.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Yves Montand","character":"César Soubeyran, aka 'le Papet'","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/wewmvQm200D2jD14G4YjSmg0WVb.jpg"},{"name":"Gérard Depardieu","character":"Jean Cadoret, hunchback, son of Florette","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/pOpHfkYRhFJiKAiIycdguQPYfem.jpg"},{"name":"Daniel Auteuil","character":"Ugolin Soubeyran, nephew of Papet","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5asrvkdSnlYlHap3ldDNyE5opeI.jpg"},{"name":"Elisabeth Depardieu","character":"Aimée Cadoret, wife of Jean","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/eFwpmx5OKAU9Olqrl1OsIiP37IG.jpg"},{"name":"Margarita Lozano","character":"Baptistine, Piedmontese of the cave","photo":"https://image